WEBVTT

00:17:00.945 --> 00:17:05.711
Now, as scientists, we're tasked
with coming up with new ideas,

00:17:05.735 --> 00:17:08.143
new concepts, new technologies

00:17:08.167 --> 00:17:12.282
to tackle some of the world's
greatest problems,

00:17:12.306 --> 00:17:14.354
but what never ceases to amaze me

00:17:14.378 --> 00:17:18.623
is that often nature
has already done this for us,

00:17:18.647 --> 00:17:19.896
and the answer ...

00:17:20.436 --> 00:17:22.214
is right under our nose.

00:17:23.314 --> 00:17:24.465
Thank you.

00:17:24.489 --> 00:17:27.071
(Applause)